{
  "name": "II · Investigação criativa (MS06) — INATIVO",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Instagram Intelligence — investigação criativa (MS06)\n**INATIVO e SEM credenciais.** Chama só a API local do backend (`ii.ce.api.v1`, 127.0.0.1).\nA lógica fica no backend; este fluxo orquestra e é idempotente (repetir não duplica).\n\n**Humano decide:** aprovação de modelos pagos, revisão de hipóteses e aprovação do dossiê são feitas no painel/API por uma PESSOA. O backend recusa atores `n8n:`.\n\nNós desabilitados = ativação progressiva (Obsidian, eventos)."
      },
      "id": "1a6b7be7-0000-4000-8000-3f6126270b96",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ii-ce/referencia-aprovada",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7bca5dd3-0000-4000-8000-32d8b6fa32a6",
      "name": "Webhook: referência aprovada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "8fd5ad24-0000-4000-8000-5610604127d4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "f43eab00-0000-4000-8000-d73f10fea7f8",
      "name": "Teste manual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "base_url",
              "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8777",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "max_rodadas",
              "value": 3,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "cfe85a6c-0000-4000-8000-a2adf85a1858",
      "name": "Configuração",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b1",
              "name": "reference_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.reference_id ?? $json.reference_id ?? 'ref_00000000000000000000' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b2",
              "name": "depth",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.depth ?? 'standard' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b6afdc92-0000-4000-8000-70890836fc97",
      "name": "Normalizar entrada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.base_url }}/v1/open_investigation",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { reference_id: $json.reference_id, depth: $json.depth, limits: { max_calls: 4, max_usd: 0 }, requested_by: 'n8n:fluxo-investigacao' } }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "5fd98327-0000-4000-8000-6b2484defd29",
      "name": "Abrir investigação",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        100
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data.state }}",
              "rightValue": "blocked_no_evidence",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d35802ba-0000-4000-8000-9b2e0374ebda",
      "name": "Sem evidências?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.base_url }}/v1/run_investigation",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { investigation_id: $('Abrir investigação').item.json.data.investigation_id, max_tasks: 10, retry_blocked: $runIndex > 0 } }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "e11aa4e0-0000-4000-8000-3fd3576c902e",
      "name": "Executar tarefas permitidas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Configuração').first().json.base_url }}/v1/get_status",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { investigation_id: $('Abrir investigação').item.json.data.investigation_id } }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "f0214fb3-0000-4000-8000-f1079ad9aa40",
      "name": "Consultar status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1440,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "d1",
              "leftValue": "={{ ['running','partial'].includes($json.data.state) && $runIndex < $('Configuração').first().json.max_rodadas }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4888df61-0000-4000-8000-b9704e4ecb15",
      "name": "Pendências retomáveis?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1680,
        200
